            <div xml:id="d643">

                <pb facs="0966" n="846" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg846"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.74/218: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-02-16T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 16,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>36. Your 43, February 10, 11 a.m.</p>
                <p>The Department understands that the Federal Company is proceeding under its
                    concession. The president of the Federal Company is <hi rendition="#italic">en
                        route</hi> from New York to San Francisco but will be communicated with as
                    soon as possible. Meanwhile, you may if you so deem necessary intimate to
                    Chinese Minister of Communications that any effort to discredit Federal should
                    not be tolerated.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
